  fileName: ActiveCamera
  label: Active Camera
  description: Visualizes the read-only activeCamera pointers. A crosshair and squares
    are placed in front of the camera every tick and must stay centered and steady
    while the camera moves; an orange square shows the camera of the previous tick
    for comparison. Billboards use only the camera rotation, arrows only the camera
    position. A panel shows position, rotation, the origin in camera space and the
    projection values.
